WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,820
Shen Wan, there are a lot of people gathered at the stairs.

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:06,100
I'm here to be fierce. Nothing bad will happen. I'll be out right away.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,620
Don't open the door yet. Wear your weapon.

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:19,250
Ms. Shi, I just want to be a witness.

5
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,610
Yuan Zhi said you killed her brother

6
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:21,650
I want an explanation

7
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:23,250
My brother died on your doorstep

8
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:24,650
Should you give me an explanation?

9
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:30,120
My boyfriend just knocked on the door

10
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,360
I was killed by you

11
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,640
Know if it will be another neighbor’s turn next time

12
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,880
You murderers

13
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,650
Get out of our compound

14
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:37,810
i remember you

15
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:40,010
You were the one grabbing snow on the rooftop before, right?

16
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,610
Your boyfriend knocks on the door

17
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:42,970
Do it at your own risk

18
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:44,530
And he was not killed by the palace

19
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:46,900
It's frozen to death

20
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:48,740
You should ask his good brother

21
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:50,660
Why didn't you take the person back last night?

22
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:53,200
I want you to pay with your life
